    between the same two points. Measured 2026-07-27 against the real /tmp:
    one such failed rebuild left exactly 2 directories, and leaves 0 now. The
    stash lifetime moves into a try/finally, keeping both the ignore_errors
    removal and its position ahead of the report writers.
  * The regression test records every mkdtemp rather than only checking that
    the spool ends up empty, because an empty spool is equally what a run that
    never stashed anything produces. It asserts that two stashes were created
